                                                    <div class="col-4">
                                                        Haj Leave
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="col-2">
                                                        <span class="fa fa-2x fa-square-o"/>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="col-4">
                                                        Short Leave
                                                        <br/>
                                                        <small>(One week or less)</small>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="col-2">
                                                        <span class="fa fa-2x fa-square-o"/>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <p>No. of leave days requested: <span t-field="doc.number_of_days"/> </p>
                                                <p>Leave dates: from <span t-field="doc.request_date_from"/> to <span t-field="doc.request_date_to"/> </p>
                                                <p>Replacement Employee: ...............................................</p>
                                                <p>Vacation according to the vacation plan: Yes  <span class="fa fa-2x fa-square-o"/>  No  <span class="fa fa-2x fa-square-o"/> </p>
                                                <p>Mobile No. (During vacation): ...............................................</p>
                                                <p>E-mail Address: ...............................................</p>
                                                <p>Signature of employee: ...............................................</p>
                                                <p>Date applied: ...............................................</p>
                                                <p>Department Head / Project Manager : ...........................................................</p>
                                                <p>Operation Director Signature : ...........................................................</p>
                                            </td>
                                            <td>
