                                                <p>Current Leave balance :  .............................</p>
                                                <p>Days approved:</p>
                                                <p>Paid leave : ............................. Unpaid leave : ............................. </p>
                                                <p>HR Manager Signature: </p>
                                                <p>......................................................................................</p>
